<title>FRANCE: EU cuts refund on soft wheat flour exports.</title>
<headline>EU cuts refund on soft wheat flour exports.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday cut the daily refund on exports of soft wheat flour to 24.50 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 26.00 Ecus per tonne, France's grain office ONIC said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
